📊 Project Title
Predictive Attrition & Retention Strategy Dashboard
Live Simulation Model | HR Analytics Project
🎯 Project Overview

Employee attrition is a major challenge for organizations, as the loss of employees can increase recruitment costs, reduce productivity, and affect organizational performance.

The Predictive Attrition & Retention Strategy Dashboard is an interactive HR Analytics project designed to identify employees with a high probability of leaving the organization.

The dashboard analyzes employee-level attrition risk and identifies the primary factors contributing to potential turnover. It also includes a live retention strategy simulation, allowing users to adjust organizational improvement factors and observe their potential impact on employee attrition risk.

The model includes 50 employees and evaluates four major retention factors:

Compensation & Rewards
Career & Growth
Manager Quality
Work Design (Work-Life Balance)
🎯 Project Objectives
Identify employees with high attrition risk.
Predict employee-level attrition probability.
Identify the primary vulnerability affecting each employee.
Analyze baseline attrition risk across the workforce.
Simulate retention strategies using interactive controls.
Compare baseline and post-strategy attrition risk.
Support HR decision-making through data-driven insights.
