🧠 Simulation Logic

The dashboard begins with a baseline attrition risk for each employee.

The user can then improve organizational retention strategies through the four available levers.

The simulated model evaluates the potential impact of:

Improved Compensation
        ↓
Reduced Attrition Risk

Improved Career Growth
        ↓
Reduced Attrition Risk

Improved Manager Quality
        ↓
Reduced Attrition Risk

Improved Work-Life Balance
        ↓
Reduced Attrition Risk

The employee's primary vulnerability receives particular attention during the simulation.

